        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-parameter-expressivity-4> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-repro-package> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Uriz et al. (2003) & Aizenberg et al. (2005) sponge spicule silicatein axial symmetry, concentric biosilica lamination, Euplectella checkerboard lattice mechanics, cohesive-zone laminate bending, helical cage ridges and basalia waveguiding — Reproducibility package: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Deterministic (no RNG; bitwise two-run check L2091-2094), `--self-test` passes all 12 checks in ~5 s (8 Pass 2 + 4 Pass 3 at L2096-2143: FE parity, cohesive-law integral, graceful vs catastrophic with identical first-crack load, fused = monolith, k_cat -> N monotone, psi_opt = 45 deg, parallel-axis identity, ray trace vs TIR, Gloge bracket, single mode at 2 um, PASS3_JSON present, 18 measurements), default render ~5.5 s producing the main PNG, growth GIF, Pass 3 mechanics PNG and bending-fracture GIF, and `--skip-pass3` / `--skip-gif` shorten the run. Deductions: `--seed` is accepted but does nothing (L2160) (-2); the two PNGs are excluded by the repository `.gitignore` (*.png) so the rendered figures are not tracked artefacts (pre-existing convention) (-2); no requirements lock or recorded SHA-256 of the rendered outputs in the script itself (-3); the self-test asserts the specimen angle against the JSON copy of its own output (L2087) (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
